- Uses **real coordinates** + configurable `walk_speed_kmh` (default 4.5)
- Haversine distance → minimum time → compare against gap between consecutive steps
- Also catches: overlapping activities at different locations

##### [NEW] [core/validators/budget.py](file:///d:/Github_Clones/TripAgent/core/validators/budget.py)
